      "urlId": "art-on-the-wall-3-rp74g",
      "title": "ART | ON THE WALL",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a9e299b0c422719a9d79ea6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"395660bcc715aa245c58\" id=\"block-395660bcc715aa245c58\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Hey y’all, it’s me, Cassie!</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">You may know me from around the taproom or from around town, usually talking up cider, our projects and, most importantly, our fam. This time, I’m taking a turn and putting some of my art on the wall!</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Art is a love for me. I love making it, I love getting lost in it, and I love that everyone can see something and feel something different when looking at the same piece. My work tends to be abstract or nonobjective, and I feel my way through it, with color, layers, movement, energy, moments, textures, and emotion.</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">If it means something to you, that means everything to me. My dream is for my art to be out and about in the world, finding a person, finding a home, finding a wall, and hopefully bringing some joy.</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">So, come have a cider and take a look. Maybe one of these pieces will find its way home with you. I would be forever grateful. 💚</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Check out my minis and posters for sale at the taproom too, and keep in touch - @<a href=\"http://c.gal.art\">c.gal.art</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-395660bcc715aa245c58 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-395660bcc715aa245c58 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-395660bcc715aa245c58 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-395660bcc715aa245c58 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-395660bcc715aa245c58 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
