      "title": "MUSIC | matt johnson",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ac12eee3979164542b84662\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4\" id=\"block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎶 We’re so excited Matt Johnson is stepping in last minute. Music is a go! </p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Trevin Nelson | CANCELLED</strong></p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Friday, October 30 • 6:30–8:30 PM</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Trevin Nelson is a <span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--lightAccent\">multi-instrumentalist</span>, <span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">singer</span>, and songwriter whose passion for music brought him deep&nbsp;into the traditions&nbsp;of American&nbsp;folk music and beyond. His music is a tapestry of traditional sounds informed by modernity.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">No Cover · Dog Friendly · Kid Friendly </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  #block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-blend\n  : normal;\n    }\n  \n\n  #block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n    --blur-value: blur(15px);}\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-d84bdc9abfb45de9b9b4 {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-