      "title": "CLASS | FLOW &amp; RESTORATIVE YOGA",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ad9837209f9ec1ad0b1e6e3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"5ee9039b0fe8686699af\" id=\"block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Besides being an all-around awesome person, Kevin is a Registered Yoga Teacher with a 500-hour certification. He teaches all levels of vinyasa, power, Yin, reiki, hot and restorative classes. </p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space: normal !important;white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\">You can find him teaching an all-level flow and restorative class every Sunday at the Taproom from 10a - 11a. Drop-in is $22 and includes a free 4oz pour of your choice after class.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space: normal !important;white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\">In Kevin’s words, \"I &nbsp;hope to share the tools I’ve learned from others to help you fill up your cup, so that we may be of better service to the world.” Connect with Kevin on IG <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/flynnyoga/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">@flynnyoga</span></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-5ee9039b0fe8686699af .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
