      "urlId": "music-ukulele-dave-1-k3wpb-gpyyp-mapgb-63nx8",
      "title": "MUSIC | UKULELE DAVE",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ad985f18c918b1fd989fa7b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"2dfd4367d5d6e907c5b2\" id=\"block-2dfd4367d5d6e907c5b2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">It’s Aloha Friday 🌺</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Ukulele Dave brings island vibes back to the taproom — fingerpicked classics, reggae grooves, and Hawaiian sounds flowing all evening 🤙</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Originally from Palm Beach, Florida and now in Colorado’s Front Range, Ukulele Dave brings a diverse wave of sound to the Rockies. Playing Hawaii’s instrument in a unique fingerpicking style, his sets flow through Classic Rock, Reggae, Hawaiian, and more.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-2dfd4367d5d6e907c5b2 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-2dfd4367d5d6e907c5b2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-2dfd4367d5d6e907c5b2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-te