      "urlId": "10-year-ciderversary-party",
      "title": "10 YEAR CIDERVERSARY PARTY",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ad98644afc402751e81d8d5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"4c519d22983af186b4cf\" id=\"block-4c519d22983af186b4cf\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎉 10 Freaking Years of St. Vrain Cidery! 🍎🥂</h1><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Just a friendly reminder of what we think you should be doing on <strong>Saturday, November 7!</strong> 😉</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Come hang out with us as we celebrate <strong>10 freaking years of filling glasses and making memories!</strong> ❤️🍻</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Ten years of bringing people together, celebrating the good stuff, and making St. Vrain Cidery what it is today. And we’re celebrating the only way we know how: with good people, great music, special pours, and a whole lot of fun!</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎶 <strong>Taylor Sims Band | 6:30–8:30 PM</strong><br>🍎 <strong>Limited Releases &amp; Special Pours</strong> — you won’t want to miss these!<br>🍜 <strong>Sam &amp; Sam Authentic Asian Eats</strong> — come hungry!<br>🥂 <strong>Cider, community, and 10 years of memories</strong> — need we say more?</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Longmont and beyond, you’ve been part of this story, and we can’t wait to celebrate with you. Come raise a glass, grab a bite, enjoy the music, and help us kick off another decade of good times.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-large\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>10 years down. Plenty more memories to make.</strong> 🥂🎉🍎</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-4c519d22983af186b4cf .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  #block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n      --tweak-text-block-blend\n  : normal;\n    }\n  \n\n  #block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n    --blur-value: blur(15px);}\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-4c519d22983af186b4cf .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-4c519d22983af186b4cf {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
