      "title": "OPEN MIC | W/ Danny SHAFER",
      "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ab05f81b16a16218d31076b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/0adf77ad-25ba-4033-b57d-f0d5d3117ab8_1023/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c\" id=\"block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎤 <span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\">the midweek mic </span>w/ Danny Shafer!</h2><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">✨ Here’s the scoop:</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>📆</strong> 2nd &amp; 4th Wednesdays</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>⏰</strong> 6:30 – 8:30 PM (Signup begins at 6 PM)</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>📍</strong>St. Vrain Cidery Taproom</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎶 What to Expect</h4><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Whether you’re a seasoned performer or just dipping your toes into live performance, <em>The Midweek Mic</em> is your stage. Bring your guitar, your voice, your poems, or your stories—we welcome all kinds of performers! Grab a cider, cheer on your neighbors, and be part of a fun, supportive night of music and community.</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🎸 About Danny Shafer</h4><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The night is hosted by the incredible <strong>Danny Shafer</strong>, a longtime Colorado musician known for his heartfelt songwriting, warm stage presence, and years of experience building community around live music. Danny has played thousands of shows across the country and continues to inspire with his mix of Americana, folk, and roots music. With Danny at the helm, you can count on a welcoming, encouraging environment for performers and an unforgettable evening for listeners.</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">🍎Come share your talent—or just kick back and soak up the vibes. <em>The Midweek Mic</em> is all about celebrating creativity, connection and good cider.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-3a5c9a5d4fa48135b74c {\n         